# Aurex Full-Stack Engineering Internship — Week 4

## Intern Information

**Name:** Ayesha Saddiqa
**Domain:** Full-Stack Web Development
**Week:** Week 4

---

## Project

### Task Manager Web Application

A browser-based Task Manager application developed as part of Week 4 of the Aurex Full-Stack Engineering Internship.

The project focuses on JavaScript programming fundamentals, DOM manipulation, events, form handling, validation, and data persistence using `localStorage`.

