## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- DOM Manipulation
- Browser Events
- LocalStorage
- Git & GitHub

---

## Features Implemented

- Add new tasks
- Edit existing tasks
- Delete tasks
- Mark tasks as completed
- Display total, pending, and completed task counts
- Search tasks by title or description
- Filter tasks by:
  - All
  - Pending
  - Completed

- Task priority selection
- Form validation
- Dynamic task card creation using JavaScript
- Dynamic progress percentage
- Progress bar based on completed tasks
- Data persistence using `localStorage`
- Tasks remain available after refreshing the browser
- Notification button showing the number of pending tasks
- Dashboard navigation
- My Tasks navigation
- Completed Tasks navigation
- Responsive user interface

